QueryPerformanceCounter without a syscall: RtlQueryPerformanceCounter reads the counter in PE
code from the macOS commpage, like libsystem's mach_continuous_time (ntdll). Faster process
starts: no OpenGL driver load for the GPU list without EGL (win32u opengl.c), font files from
CTFontManagerCopyAvailableFontURLs instead of font descriptors (win32u freetype.c).
--- a/dlls/ntdll/unixlib.h
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unixlib.h
@@ -78,6 +78,46 @@
